Subject: [PATCH 34/38] pipeline workers' watch line +
 VICTORY_PIPELINE_PRIORITY=normal (dark-cell hunt)

Every 2 s while pipelines are queued: queue lengths, made/loaded/started_early,
what each worker does and for how long, the library calls running
(VICTORY_PIPELINE_WATCH=0: off). VICTORY_PIPELINE_PRIORITY=normal: workers at
the title's priority instead of below it.

